<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      table {
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
      }
      
      th, td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 8px;
      }
      
      tr:nth-child(even){background-color: #f2f2f2}
      
      th {
        background-color: #04AA6D;
        color: white;
      }
      .header {
  padding: 60px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #1abc9c;
  color: white;
  font-size: 30px;
}
      </style>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h2><h1><%= title %></h1>
        <p>여기는 글을 쓰는 곳이야</p></h2>
    </div>
    
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>글 쓰는 곳</th>
      <tr>
      <td><form action="/board/write" method="post">
        제목    : <input type="text" name="title"><br>
        글쓴이  : <input type="text" name="author"></textarea><br>
        내용    : <textarea name="contents"></textarea><br>
        <input type="submit" value="확인">
      </form><ul class="navbar-nav"></ul>
      <a href="/" class="nav-link">홈으로 돌아가기</a></li>
      <ul class="navbar-nav">
    </td>
      
    </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>

